# Marketing review: launch-copy.md vs product/spec.md

**Review date:** 2026-09-10

**Source of truth:** `product/spec.md` (modified 2026-09-10T18:27:34-04:00)

## Findings

| Claim in launch-copy.md | Spec says | Verdict |
|---|---|---|
| "Works offline, anywhere." | "Offline support: removed in this release." | **Unsupported** – the spec explicitly removes offline support. |
| "Export to CSV, PDF and Excel in one click." | "Export: CSV only." | **Unsupported** – the spec lists only CSV export; PDF and Excel are not present and not implied. |

## Summary

**2 unsupported claims.** Every phrase in the launch copy is contradicted or unsubstantiated by the current product spec. The copy appears to describe a previous or planned feature set, not the release the current spec defines.
